@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/books
@baseUrl1 = http://localhost:8080/api/books-manual-query
### Access H2 DB
GET {{baseUrl}}/h2-console

### Create a Book Using Dummy DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/using-dummy-dto
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Laptop"
}

### Create a Book With db Insertion
POST {{baseUrl}}/with-db-insertion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "On the Origin of Species",
  "author": "Charles Darwin",
  "year": 1859
}

### Get All Books
GET {{baseUrl}}

### Get All Books With Pageable
GET {{baseUrl}}/pageable?page=1&size=1&sort=author,desc

### Get All Books With Title Containing
GET {{baseUrl1}}/title-containing/b

